  1061 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1062 				; Set_Menu_Demo_Attrs - poke palette_id<<4 into the expanded attribute map's
  1063 				; (MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM) cell covering each of the demo overlay's 8 squares,
  1064 				; for all MENU_DEMO_SQUARE rows each square spans.  Plain CPU loop (no
  1065 				; blitter - a small, one-time boot fixup; every other cell stays palette 0
  1066 				; from the boot-time clear).  MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM is exactly bank-
  1067 				; aligned, so a running byte offset from its start splits cleanly into a
  1068 				; bank number (offset's upper nibbles) and a window address (offset's low
  1069 				; 12 bits) - recomputed every byte, since the covered rows straddle the
  1070 				; $35xxx/$36xxx bank boundary partway through (row 25 already crosses it).
  1071 				; Called once from start:.
