   812 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   813 				; Selector_HiRow - A = list index.  Recolours just that cell's name field
   814 				; (attribute bytes only, via the blitter - no glyph redraw), highlighted if the
   815 				; index == Sel_Index, else normal.  No-op if the cell isn't on screen.  Used by
   816 				; the nav keys: a cursor move only changes which cell carries the highlight.
