   900
   901 				;=============================================================================
   902 				; Selector status line (row 20) - the highlighted image's description (typed
   903 				; in the converter, default = source filename without extension; up to
   904 				; NFO_NAME_CAP = 75 chars).  Reading a file per row stuttered a fresh
   905 				; directory, so instead the converter writes all the descriptions once into
   906 				; "IMAGES.LST" (8-byte key + description per record) beside the images.  Nfo_Name_LoadManifest slurps that in one pass on every
   907 				; Rescan_Images into NFO_NAME_VRAM (NFO_NAME_SLOT bytes/ordinal); the draw path
   908 				; is then a pure VRAM read.  No IMAGES.LST -> every slot stays $00 -> the line
   909 				; is simply blank.
   910 				;=============================================================================
   911
   912 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   913 				; Nfo_Name_ClearCache - blitter-wipe NFO_NAME_VRAM to $00 (every slot "no
   914 				; name").  Kicks BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR and waits (Nfo_Name_LoadManifest fills
   915 				; after).
   916 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   917 5675			Nfo_Name_ClearCache
   918 5675 A9 BD			lda #BLT_NFO_NAME_CLEAR-BLT_CLEAR
