  1941 				; Sel_Key_Quit - open the "Q" quit-confirm overlay: stash the covered
  1942 				; rectangle, frame it, show the prompt, and hand control to Quit_Confirm_Keys
  1943 				; (UI_Mode 5).  Q is only ever recognized here - every other screen ignores
  1944 				; it - so quitting always passes through this confirmation.
  1945 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1946 5D11			Sel_Key_Quit
  1947 				; Laid out like the APOD viewer's quit box: a double-line window with the
  1948 				; question, and two single-line "buttons" - Y (green) and N (red):
  1949 				;   +======================+
  1950 				;   | Are You Sure To Quit |
  1951 				;   |     +---+  +---+     |
  1952 				;   |     | Y |  | N |     |
  1953 				;   |     +---+  +---+     |
  1954 				;   +======================+
