  2063 				; Selector_Sync_Cursor - pull the selector highlight back onto File_Index.
  2064 				; Space / Backspace (image view) and the slideshow move File_Index while an
  2065 				; image is on screen; call this before returning to the selector so its
  2066 				; highlight follows the picture you were actually looking at, scrolling the
  2067 				; grid if the entry is off-screen.  Shares Sel_Top_For_Index with the nav keys.
  2068 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
