  2178 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2179 				; Selector_Handle_I - load the selected image's "<name>.NFO" and open the info
  2180 				; viewer (UI_Mode 4).  "Reading nfo..." shows in row 0 during the load; the
  2181 				; info screen is then built in the back buffer and shown by Read_Key_Done in
  2182 				; one blit.  Missing file -> row 0 restored, selector stays up.  A directory /
  2183 				; ".." row has no .NFO - ignored, no disk access.
  2184 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2185 5E90			Selector_Handle_I
  2186 5E90 AD 8B 04			lda ImageCount
