  2873 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  2874 				; Path_Save_Last_Segment - Up_Name = Scan_Path's last "SEG>", space-padded to
  2875 				; 8 like an IMAGE_BANK record (all spaces if Scan_Path is empty).  Called just
  2876 				; before Path_Pop_Segment so Sel_Find_Up_Name can re-highlight that folder.
